osoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/d3d12/nf-d3d12-d3d12createdevice), when the `ppDevice` parameter of `D3D12CreateDevice` is `null`, it can verify whether a device can be created without actually creating one. Therefore, it should be possible to use this method to determine if an adapter is truly available.\r\n\r\nAlthough I'm not entirely sure if my code is correct, I have conducted simple tests on both a Windows 11 virtual machine and a physical machine. Now, it correctly triggers rendering fallback in the virtual machine, and the physical machine can also use `d3d12` normally.\r\n\r\nIt's still uncertain what impact this has on performance.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-11-01T20:56:49Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T21:11:00Z","closed_at":"2025-11-05T18:19:29Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"077a988799119dac111508c339fc676f748ae409","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"scgm0:Improve-`RenderingContextDriverD3D12--_initialize_devices`","ref"